// @description: A tiny Bol Processor grammar from Bernard Bel’s corpus (1998), self-described as “a very simple grammar that does almost nothing”: a handful of notes and a rest. The clearest look at a bare grammar, derived by BPx inside Kanopi. Ctrl+Enter to play, Ctrl+. to silence.
// @language: bp3
// @outputs: audio
