// Bol Processor version BP2.9.1
// Grammar file saved as '-gr.doeslittle'. Date: Mar 11 Aož 1998 -- 14:02
-se.doeslittle

// A very simple grammar that does almost nothing

RND

S --> C3 ¥ C4 ¥ D4 C4 F#3 ¥ A3 ¥ C4
S --> G2 C3 _ B2 C3
S --> {C4 D4 E4 F4, G4 D4 C5} -